## Spec: Configurable arrow-key playhead nudge

### UI
- Gear button top-right of TaggerView 80vw container (near title)
- Dropdown: "Keyboard nudge" opens native <dialog> modal
- Modal: number input (ms), Save closes dialog; Cancel closes without save
- Min 100ms, max 60000ms; default 2000

### Behavior
- Arrow Left/Right use nudgeMs/1000 as seconds delta
- Persist via localStorage key tp_tagger_nudge_ms
- Hook usePersistedNudgeMs mirrors volumeStorage load/clamp/save pattern

